('AUR A1', 'AUR A1', 'AugShort', 'weapons', 'A selective fire bullpup weapon. The compact design and the short barrel make the weapon suitable for CQB. It''s fed by a dedicated magazine. Uses 5.56x45mm rounds.', 'Military Convoys, Helicopter Crash Sites (Chernarus)', 'Rare to Very Rare', 'Chernarus, Livonia, Nasdara', 'AugShort', '/img/items/augshort.webp', 'Assault Rifles', '6x3', 3.2, 'Tier 2-4 · Rare to Very Rare', 110, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5.56x45mm Rounds, 5.56x45mm Tracer Rounds', 'Semi-Auto, Burst, Full-Auto', '30rd AUR Mag', 11),
('AUR AX', 'AUR AX', 'Aug', 'weapons', 'A selective fire bullpup weapon. A modern variant of the AUR A1. The railing on the top and the magazine docking system have been adapted to work with standard western accessories.', 'Contaminated Zone and Helicopter Crash Sites', 'Extremely Rare', 'Chernarus, Livonia, Nasdara', 'Aug', '/img/items/aug.webp', 'Assault Rifles', '8x3', 3.6, 'Tier 3 / Unique · Extremely Rare', 110, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5.56x45mm Rounds, 5.56x45mm Tracer Rounds', 'Semi-Auto, Burst, Full-Auto', '30rd AUR Mag, 30rd Standardized Mag, 60rd Standardized Mag, 10rd Mag-C Mag, 20rd Mag-C Mag, 30rd Mag-C Mag, 40rd Mag-C Mag', 11),
('KA-101', 'KA-101', 'AK101', 'weapons', 'Selective-fire assault rifle fed from a detachable magazine. Export version of modernized KA-74M with compatible attachments. Uses 5.56x45mm rounds.', 'Military', 'Very Rare', 'Chernarus, Livonia, Sakhal, Nasdara', 'AK101', '/img/items/ak101.webp', 'Assault Rifles', '8x3', 3.077, 'Tier 3-4 · Very Rare', 110, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5.56x45mm Rounds, 5.56x45mm Tracer Rounds', 'Semi-Auto, Full-Auto', '30rd KA-101 Mag', 11),
